Package: paraver-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Paraver parallel program visualization and analysis tool (OpenHPC)
 Paraver is a very flexible data browser that is a performance analysis tool
 to explore trace files generated by Extrae. It can be used to analyze any
 information expressed as events or counters at given timestamps.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
